[93739]="Exploring the Horde\031\031Speak with Nazgrel in Grommash Hold to receive further instructions. Use the instructions received to locate and speak with Vol'jin, Cairne Bloodhoof, and Lady Sylvanas Windrunner.\031\031\031\031Obtain Instructions from Nazgrel",
